<abstract>
<para>
This handbook describes the lzip protocol.
</para>
</abstract>

<keywordset>
<keyword>TDE</keyword>
<keyword>lzip</keyword>
<keyword>protocol</keyword>
</keywordset>

</articleinfo>

<para>Lzip is a lossless data compression format.</para>

<para>The lzip tdeioslave is not directly usable and is intended for use
as a filter. For example, the tar tdeioslave can filter a file through
the lzip tdeioslave in order to display the contents of a <literal
role="extension">tar.lz</literal> file directly in a &konqueror;
window.</para>

</article>
